<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-15T06:01:58.620Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:01:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gangs are kidnapping local officials to force the release of detained members, while the Mexican defense minister reports cartels using drones to scout border agents and map smuggling routes. The U.S. Treasury has sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities tied to a cartel-controlled horse-racing and business network that includes ties to New Mexico. Cartel operatives are stealing U.S. rental cars and trucks to convert them into armored vehicles for cross-border operations. Flooding from Hurricane Simon and Tropical Storm Rachel remnants killed six people, including children, in Mexico. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPR01KYUphZnRkb1BYc2NERUdWakRfeFZBenJqV2FnLTk0M2VCbDlMS05JMDUzVXk5dzFjalphYzhOek85U1plMkphWFF0cmF6eFBJQ2Q3S2NrUGhaZ2pCWmtwOEJJUkYyb3hDaG9VM0lpZUN2eWtBMW1VZ2F1ak80M2phYUVuODYyeGZuSjVqdmtZRnNLN2J5aHkyNUlWd0ozc3pOakFfdmhKZDdYcHFva3o1NmJpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNVGM2dm9HNmlqTkdMODFpV09LT2YxRWloWXUtTk5KaFV1NTVxWDMtNlRwZDY3Z2M3WFBpZ2JVS2tsVUY5eko1Mldtd3RPMTM3aFFaNGZYS3dZbkZvbjZLelNISHB1dlk1Z3B2Zy1xWVJudzhIaXVXeWNjQkxIX2x5VThzUnZ1Y25HTjV5eHBVNm1jSlk3S1c2Qm90ZkZLUkRpU3JHX18tdld4U0U0R2hhVHdwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBuR3R3SFZReE52WVpId0NHc015TnVwdGwySy05d1A3N01zUjhYYTJIUGlwbzQ5UWtzZGRmN2c3TGtPX2l5R3lLUWVTNUlDRUo2MGNKMTlxZEM4Wkc4QXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPOXhDQ3dIbkpmRndpS3NsTFF4SDdIb3Y4QVh2dXEwZDQzME1jRHY4cHlXVmdEV2h3anRMRXB6Uld5YWt0SGxFeklpTl9xdGk1ODJIbUFaYmc4R1M2cWZ1dHNITVVRZzI1N0JCbG43UW83QXJVYjQ5anRnbzFsYTBjcFNTdWt0YWtQeGFJRGNGSTkwUjFvdDJJVVJ4QkRUSkQ4QmdJU